    "innovation": "This study uses an Earth System Model to demonstrate that increasing greenhouse gas concentrations strengthen tropical upwelling, which lengthens the period and weakens the easterly phase of the Quasi-Biennial Oscillation by counteracting the wave forcing that drives the oscillation.",
